
### Create a patient
POST http://localhost:8082/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Patient",
  "email": "patient@example.com",
  "active": true
}


### Retrieve the patient
GET http://localhost:8082/api/patients/1

###eligibility
GET http://localhost:8082/api/patients/1/eligibility

###missing
GET http://localhost:8082/api/patients/99999

